      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Roscoe%2C_Illinois",
      "category": "transport",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "In 1847 the Roscoe Female Seminary was founded, which later evolved into Rockford University.",
